{"2912530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Legend of Azarias Rebirth", "steam_appid": 2912530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2912610], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/892080884d6e7e8540a415a4d0ea4a95.poster.avif?t=1728958823\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/892080884d6e7e8540a415a4d0ea4a95.webm?t=1728958823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/892080884d6e7e8540a415a4d0ea4a95.mp4?t=1728958823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Angel Raphael in this immersive and action-packed first-person dungeon crawler. Travel through 24 floors, each presenting a new challenge to overcome with new demons to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense combat against a variety of demonic enemies, with the strategy and strength behind them increasing with each new floor. Uncover hidden side quests that offer new power to destroy anything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/c794cb0c1fb202a16289711fa601dd57.poster.avif?t=1728958823\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/c794cb0c1fb202a16289711fa601dd57.webm?t=1728958823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912530/extras/c794cb0c1fb202a16289711fa601dd57.mp4?t=1728958823